3. NHC CORRECTION STRENGTH CHECK
======================================================================
Auditing codebase in sih/fusion/es_ekf.py:
  - Configuration flags: nhc_lateral_std = 0.15, nhc_vertical_std = 0.15, enable_nhc = True
  - Execution status during AI-velocity prediction:
    In ErrorStateEKF.predict(), when vel is provided:
      v_e = v_fwd * sin(heading), v_n = v_fwd * cos(heading), v_u = 0.0
    Lateral velocity in vehicle frame is assumed 0 analytically.
    --> ZERO Kalman measurement update (K * (0 - v_lat)) is performed on the error-state vector.
    --> Orientation error delta_theta is NEVER updated by NHC.
    --> Heading change delta_heading = 0.0 rad at every step from NHC.

